<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Educor 17.1 mln rand issue to fund 3 sites.</title>
<headline>Educor 17.1 mln rand issue to fund 3 sites.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Recently-listed Education Investment Corp Ltd said on Friday it would raise 17.1 million rand via the issue of six million shares at 285 cents each.</p>
<p>The funds will be used to buy three sites for the development of new campuses.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
